  "solution": {
    "text": "For the precipitation of MS form a solution of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> by passing <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>sp</mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>MS</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>M</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>S</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />or <math><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />or <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br />i.e. precipitation of MS will start when <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> provides<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mtext>ion of S</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />For <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>S</mtext><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mo>+</mo> </msup> <mo>+</mo><msup> <mtext>S</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mtext>pH=0.9826</mtext></math>"
